a.q('installed_topology_resolution',['install_verification'],'For shared-toolchain workspaces verify binding and configured mutable roots, failing closed for absent binding file, product root, command, event log, runtime, projection or archive root. Runtime commands needing installed context load admitted binding before choosing roots; missing/malformed binding is resolution error, never fallback to target defaults.',[g(0,138,148)])
