a.q('artifact_refusal_and_identity',['supplied_artifact'],'Verification refuses typed content, identity, descriptor or contribution mismatch, unresolved/incompatible dependency and unsupported contract; refused artifacts become neither installed, bound, admitted nor callable. Verified install identity includes namespace/version/content; different bytes cannot overwrite/reuse it. Existing product/version with different content, descriptor, contribution or lock is typed conflict. Source-blind verify/install/import uses only public contracts/release evidence, needing no mutable source, private module, helper or source-built shim.',[g(5,263,282)])
