a.q('binding_exactness',['multi_product_binding'],'Each row records namespace/product/package/version/digest/descriptor/contribution/product-manifest path+digest/installed roots/lock/compatibility and applicable public commands/contracts. Preserve exact dependency graph and lock; unbound, unresolved, incompatible, ambiguous or content-mismatched products cannot be substituted from another workspace/source/ambient package/previous lock. Install and bind are separate operations, not aliases; binding yields candidate contributions, not catalog admission/readiness/visibility/eligibility/callability. Catalog products acquire no runtime-root/event/traversal/continuation/worker/retry/closure control; selected ABG owns these.',[g(6,292,317)])
a.q('immutable_binding_evolution',['multi_product_binding'],'No automatic re-resolution or mutable global current-binding pointer. Multiple immutable identities may coexist; changed lock/product set needs separately supplied/admitted binding, and use on a continued spine needs exact covering reprice. 5.0 requires initial exact install/bind, not update/disable/unbind/uninstall/retirement/revocation/supersession.',[g(6,319,326)])
