a.q('installer_candidate_acceptance',['install_truth','install_verification','cold_agent_bootstrap','multi_product_binding'],'A tenant installer is not RC-complete until a clean workspace proves substrate root, shared binding/versioned product payload resolution, exact manifests/commands/mutable roots, no local full dependency copy or top-level shims, closed failure of legacy/missing selectors, full standards with copy evidence, structured provenance, explicit imported/clean behavior, classification, discoverable versioned marker-refreshed context, deterministic repeat/remediation, persistent inspectable proof, source-blind preverification, exact multi-product set/lock, separate installed/bound/admitted/visible/callable states, observation-stable authority/binding with separate snapshots and initial-lifecycle limit. All paths use complete Product-derived public definitions without legacy/parallel registers; operation count is only a derived no-silence projection.',[g(8,365,405)])
